### 服务信息
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/

### 健康检查
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/health

### 分类
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/news/categories

### 新闻列表
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/news/list?page=1&pageSize=10

### 按分类
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/news/list?categoryId=1&page=1&pageSize=10

### 新闻详情
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/news/detail?id=1

### 浏览计数
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/news/1/view

### 注册
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo_user",
  "password": "Passw0rd!"
}

### 登录（把返回的 token 填到下面）
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "demo_user",
  "password": "Passw0rd!"
}

### 当前用户
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/user/info
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 收藏
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/favorite/add
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newsId": 1
}

### 收藏列表
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/favorite/list?page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 写历史
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/history/add
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "newsId": 1
}

### 历史列表
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/history/list?page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### AI 对话（SSE）
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/v1/ai/chat
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "qwen-plus",
  "messages": [
    { "role": "user", "content": "用三句话介绍这个新闻项目" }
  ]
}
